# Operator allow list this build is reduced to (--include_ops_by_config).
#
# Format: <domain>;<opset>;<Op1>,<Op2>,...
#
# Source models (RAGFlow DeepDoc, converted from PaddlePaddle):
#   det.ort, layout.ort (plus the laws/manual/paper domain variants),
#   rec.ort, tsr.ort
#
# Regenerate this file whenever the models change:
#   onnxruntime/scripts/gen_required_ops.sh --models <dir-with-.ort-files>
# A model that needs an operator missing here fails at runtime with
# "Could not find an implementation for <Op>(<opset>)", so a stale list is a
# production outage, not a build warning.
#
# The com.microsoft entry is REQUIRED, not leftover: PaddlePaddle conversion
# emits fused kernels (FusedConv, FusedMatMul, QuickGelu). Do not "clean up"
# this line by adding --disable_contrib_ops to the build - that makes every
# DeepDoc model fail to load.
ai.onnx;1;Conv,GlobalAveragePool,LayerNormalization,Shape,Softmax,Squeeze,Transpose
ai.onnx;4;Concat
ai.onnx;5;Reshape
ai.onnx;6;Clip,Relu,Sigmoid
ai.onnx;7;Add,Div,Mul
ai.onnx;9;BatchNormalization,Cast,MatMul
ai.onnx;10;AveragePool,Slice
ai.onnx;11;Clip,Concat,Conv,ConvTranspose,Resize,TopK
ai.onnx;12;MaxPool
ai.onnx;13;Cast,Concat,Flatten,GatherElements,Mod,ReduceMax,Resize,Sigmoid,Softmax,Split,Tile,Transpose,Unsqueeze
ai.onnx;14;Add,Div,Mul,Reshape,Sub
com.microsoft;1;FusedConv,FusedMatMul,QuickGelu
